### Release Notes

<details>
<summary>UpCloudLtd/terraform-provider-upcloud (upcloud)</summary>

### [`v5.39.0`](https://github.com/UpCloudLtd/terraform-provider-upcloud/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#5390---2026-06-09)

[Compare Source](https://github.com/UpCloudLtd/terraform-provider-upcloud/compare/v5.38.0...v5.39.0)

##### Added

- upcloud\_server: add `password` attribute to `login` block for retrieving system generated one-time password.

##### Changed

- upcloud\_server: change `login` block from set to list to avoid `password` attribute causing resource to be recreated. The maximum length for `login` block is one, so this is not a breaking change.

### [`v5.38.0`](https://github.com/UpCloudLtd/terraform-provider-upcloud/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#5380---2026-05-21)

[Compare Source](https://github.com/UpCloudLtd/terraform-provider-upcloud/compare/v5.37.0...v5.38.0)

##### Added

- upcloud\_file\_storage: add `encrypt` attribute.

### [`v5.37.0`](https://github.com/UpCloudLtd/terraform-provider-upcloud/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#5370---2026-05-12)

[Compare Source](https://github.com/UpCloudLtd/terraform-provider-upcloud/compare/v5.36.3...v5.37.0)

##### Added

- upcloud\_kubernetes\_node\_group: `name_prefix` field to help generating a unique name for the node group. This enables using `create_before_destroy` lifecycle setting with the node-group resource.

##### Fixed

- upcloud\_server: use 64-bit integers when parsing server host value from JSON response. No changes to the resource schema.

### [`v5.36.3`](https://github.com/UpCloudLtd/terraform-provider-upcloud/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#5363---2026-04-24)

[Compare Source](https://github.com/UpCloudLtd/terraform-provider-upcloud/compare/v5.36.2...v5.36.3)

##### Fixed

- upcloud\_server: fix panic when removing only backup rule in the server

</details>

